    "statementHTML": "<div class=\"statement-body\">\n<div class=\"statement-section statement-goal\">\n   <h2><span class=\"icon icon-goal\">&nbsp;</span><span>Goal </span></h2>\n   <span class=\"question-statement\">Modify bit <var>bit</var> of <var>number</var>: <const>ON</const> sets it to <const>1</const>, <const>OFF</const> sets it to <const>0</const>, and <const>TOGGLE</const> flips it.<br><br>Bits are numbered from <const>0</const> on the right (the least significant bit). Each command is independent. Print each resulting number in decimal.</span>\n</div>\n<div class=\"statement-section statement-protocol\">\n   <div class=\"blk\">\n      <div class=\"title\">Input</div>\n      <div class=\"question-statement-input\"><strong>Line 1:</strong> An integer <var>n</var>, the number of commands.<br><strong>Next <var>n</var> lines:</strong> Two integers <var>number</var>, <var>bit</var> and a word <var>command</var>, separated by spaces.</div>\n   </div>\n   <div class=\"blk\">\n      <div class=\"title\">Output</div>\n      <div class=\"question-statement-output\"><strong><var>n</var> lines:</strong> The resulting decimal number for each command, in input order.</div>\n   </div>\n   <div class=\"blk\">\n      <div class=\"title\">Constraints</div>\n      <div class=\"question-statement-constraints\">1 &le; <var>n</var> &le; 30<br>0 &le; <var>number</var> &le; 1073741823<br>0 &le; <var>bit</var> &le; 29<br><var>command</var> is <const>ON</const>, <const>OFF</const> or <const>TOGGLE</const>.</div>\n   </div>\n   <div class=\"blk\">\n      <div class=\"title\">Example</div>\n      <div class=\"statement-inout\">\n         <div class=\"statement-inout-in\">\n            <div class=\"title\">Input</div>\n            <pre class=\"question-statement-example-in\">3\n12 0 ON\n64 6 OFF\n22 2 TOGGLE</pre>\n         </div>\n         <div class=\"statement-inout-out\">\n            <div class=\"title\">Output</div>\n            <pre class=\"question-statement-example-out\">13\n0\n18</pre>\n         </div>\n      </div>\n   </div>\n</div>"
